<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>쇼트트랙 대회 일정</title>

<style>
body{
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    background:#f5f5f5;
    margin:0;
}

header{
    background:#003366;
    color:white;
    text-align:center;
    padding:20px;
}

.container{
    max-width:1000px;
    margin:auto;
    padding:20px;
}

.card{
    background:white;
    margin-bottom:15px;
    border-radius:10px;
    padding:15px;
    box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.1);
}

.date{
    color:#666;
    font-size:14px;
}

.title{
    font-size:20px;
    font-weight:bold;
    margin:10px 0;
}

.place{
    color:#0077cc;
}

button{
    background:#0077cc;
    color:white;
    border:none;
    padding:10px 15px;
    border-radius:8px;
    cursor:pointer;
}

.detail{
    display:none;
    margin-top:15px;
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
<h1>쇼트트랙 대회 일정</h1>
</header>

<div class="container">

<div class="card">
<div class="date">2026.04.25</div>
<div class="title">2026 전국생활체육대축전 빙상대회</div>
<div class="place">창원 의창</div>

<button onclick="toggleDetail(this)">
자세히 보기
</button>

<div class="detail">
<p>세부 정보 입력</p>
<p>참가 대상 입력</p>
<p>경기 결과 입력</p>
</div>
</div>

</div>

<script>
function toggleDetail(button){
const detail = button.nextElementSibling;

if(detail.style.display==="block"){
detail.style.display="none";
button.innerText="자세히 보기";
}else{
detail.style.display="block";
button.innerText="닫기";
}
}
</script>

</body>
</html>
